# Cursor Efficiency (Token Optimization)

- Search: Use `grep` for exact matches/symbols, `codebase_search` for semantic queries only. Always specify `target_directories` to limit scope.
- Read files in parallel batches when possible. Read only necessary sections (offset/limit), not entire files.
- Be direct: Ask specific questions. Avoid exploratory searches. Use file paths from context when available.
- Tool selection: Prefer faster tools (grep > glob > codebase_search). Read files only when editing or critical.
